<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Women Yo</para>
  <para style="toc1">WOMEN YO</para>
  <para style="toc2">Women Yo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wo</para>
  <para style="mt1">WOMEN YO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Paul, yon sèvitè-atache nèt a Jésus Kri, aple kòm apot <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:15">Trav 9:15</ref></char></note>mete apa pou bòn nouvèl Bondye a, <verse eid="ROM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>ke Li te pwomèt oparavan atravè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:70">Luc 1:70</ref></char></note>pwofèt Li yo nan Ekriti Sen Yo, <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>konsènan Fis Li a ki te ne de yon desandan David <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:14">Jn 1:14</ref></char></note>selon lachè, <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>ki te deklare <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:3">Mat 4:3</ref></char></note>Fis Bondye a avèk pouvwa akoz rezirèksyon Li, ki te fè L sòti nan lanmò, atravè Lespri sentete a, Jésus Kri, Senyè nou an. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>Pa Li menm nou te resevwa gras e te rele kòm apot pou fè parèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:7">Trav 6:7</ref></char></note>obeyisans lafwa a pami tout etranje yo pou koz Sen Non Li. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Pami sila yo nou menm osi te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:1">Jd 1</ref></char></note>rele pa Jésus Kri. <verse eid="ROM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>A tout sila yo ke Bondye renmen anpil nan Rome, ke Li te rele kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:13">Trav 9:13</ref></char></note>sen yo: gras anvè nou avèk lapè ki sòti nan Bondye, Papa nou, ak Senyè a Jésus Kri.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Premyèman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:4">I Kor 1:4</ref></char></note>mwen remèsye Bondye mwen an selon Jésus Kri pou nou tout, ke lafwa nou ap pwoklame toupatou nan lemond. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Paske Bondye ke mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:14">Trav 24:14</ref></char></note>sèvi nan lespri mwen lè m preche levanjil Fis Li a, se temwen m ke m ap nonmen non nou san rete nan lapriyè mwen yo. <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>Toujou nan priyè mwen yo, m ap mande Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:21">Trav 18:21</ref></char></note>nan volonte L, dènyèman, pou L kite m vin wè nou. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Trav 19:21</ref></char></note>mwen anvi wè nou pou m kapab bannou kèk don Lespri a, pou nou kapab byen etabli. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Sa vle di, pou mwen menm kapab ankouraje ansanm avèk nou pandan mwen pami nou, nou chak pa lafwa a lòt, lafwa pa nou ak lafwa pa m tou.<verse eid="ROM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Mwen pa vle nou pa okouran, frè m yo, ke souvan mwen konn fè plan pou vin wè nou (malgre sa pa t realize). Mwen ta renmen sa fèt pou m kapab rekòlte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:36">Jn 4:36</ref></char></note>kèk fwi pami nou tou, menm jan ak tout lòt nasyon etranje yo. <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:16">I Kor 9:16</ref></char></note>Mwen gen obligasyon ni pou Grèk ni pou moun ki baba; ni pou sila ki saj ni pou sila ki ensanse yo. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Donk, Pou pati pa m, mwen gen gwo anvi pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:20">Wo 5:20</ref></char></note>preche levanjil la a nou menm osi ki nan Rome.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Paske mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 8:38">Mc 8:38</ref></char></note>pa wont de levanjil la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:18">I Kor 1:18</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 1:24">24</ref></char></note>paske se li ki pouvwa Bondye a pou sove tout moun ki kwè yo. Li la avan pou Jwif la, e dabò Grèk la tou. <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Paske se nan levanjil sa a ke ladwati Bondye revele soti nan lafwa pou rive nan lafwa, jan sa ekri a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Hab 2:4</ref></char></note>“Men moun ki jis la ap viv pa lafwa”.<verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:9">Wo 5:9</ref></char></note>lakòlè Bondye parèt soti nan syèl la kont tout enkwayans ak tout enjistis a lòm ki kache verite a ak enjistis. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:17">Trav 14:17</ref></char></note>sa ke tout moun konnen de Bondye a, byen klè pou yo, paske Bondye te fè l parèt a klè. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Paske depi nan kreyasyon mond lan tout aspè envizib Li yo, pouvwa etènèl Li ak nati diven Li an te parèt byen a klè. Sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:7-9">Job 12:7-9</ref></char></note>byen konprann menm selon sa Li te kreye. Konsa, yo rete san eskiz. <verse eid="ROM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Paske malgre yo te konnen Bondye, yo pa t bay Li lonè kòm Bondye, ni bay Li remèsiman, men yo te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:15">II Wa 17:15</ref></char></note>egare nan panse yo. Yo te vin ranpli avèk foli, e kè yo te vin fonse tounwa.<verse eid="ROM 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:14">Jr 10:14</ref></char></note>pretann ke yo te saj, yo te vin fou, <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>epi te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:16-18">Det 4:16-18</ref></char></note>ranplase laglwa a Bondye enkonwonpi a pou yon imaj ki sanblab a lòm konwonpi ak zwazo, bèt kat pye, ak bèt k ap rale sou vant yo. <verse eid="ROM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:26">Wo 1:26</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 1:28">28</ref></char></note>Bondye te livre yo a konvwatiz kè yo ak tout sa ki pa pwòp, pou kò yo te kapab dezonore pami yo menm. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Paske yo te ranplase verite Bondye a ak yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:20">És 44:20</ref></char></note>bann manti, yo te adore e sèvi kreyati a olye de Kreyatè a, ki beni pou tout tan an. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Pou rezon sila a Bondye te livre yo a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:5">I Tes 4:5</ref></char></note>pasyon k ap avili yo. Paske fanm pa yo te ranplase fonksyon lanati a pa sa ki pa nan nati a. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Epi menm jan mesye yo te abandone fonksyon natirèl fanm nan pou vin boule nan dezi anvè youn pou lòt; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:22">Lev 22:22</ref></char></note>gason avèk gason k ap fè zak malpwòp e k ap resevwa nan pwòp kò pa yo pinisyon yo merite pou erè yo a. <verse eid="ROM 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Menm jan yo pa t trouve l bon ankò pou rekonèt Bondye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:24">Wo 1:24</ref></char></note>Bondye te livre yo a yon panse tòde pou fè bagay ki pa pwòp sa yo. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Yo te vin ranpli avèk tout kalite enjistis, mechanste, konvwatiz, ak mal. Yo te plen ak anvi, touye moun, konfli, desepsyon, malis, tripotay. <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>Yo vin Medizan, lènmi a Bondye, ensolan, awogan, ògeye, envantè a mechanste <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:2">II Tim 3:2</ref></char></note>dezobeyisan a paran yo, <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>san konprann, san entegrite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:3">II Tim 3:3</ref></char></note>san lanmou, e san mizerikòd. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>Malgre yo konnen òdonans Bondye a, ke sila ki pratike bagay sa yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:2">Wo 6:2</ref></char></note>merite lanmò, yo non sèlman fè yo, men yo vin konplètman dakò avèk sila ki pratike yo tou.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>Konsa, nou vin san eskiz; nou tout ki pote jijman yo. Nan menm moman ke nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:5-7">II Sam 12:5-7</ref></char></note>jije lòt yo, nou kondannen pwòp tèt nou. Paske nou menm ki jije yo, pratike menm bagay sa yo. <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Epi nou konnen ke li jis lè jijman Bondye a tonbe sou sila ki pratike bagay sa yo. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Men èske ou sipoze sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:14">Luc 12:14</ref></char></note>o lòm; ke lè ou jije sila ki pratike bagay sa yo, epi ou menm ou fè menm bagay yo, ke ou va chape de jijman Bondye a? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Oubyen èske ou panse ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:23">Wo 9:23</ref></char></note>richès a bonte Li, tolerans ak pasyans Li se yon bagay lejè, san nou konprann ke se bonte Bondye menm ki mennen nou nan larepantans? <verse eid="ROM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Men akoz de tèt ak kè di nou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:34">Det 32:34</ref></char></note>nou ap ranmase vanjans Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:5">Sòm 110:5</ref></char></note>pou dènye gran jou kòlè a, lè Bondye ap fè vin parèt tout jijman jis Li yo. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>Li menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Sòm 62:12</ref></char></note>va rann jijman a chak moun selon tout zèv li. <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Sila yo ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:15">Luc 8:15</ref></char></note>pèsevere nan fè byen, va twouve glwa, lonè, imòtalite, ak lavi etènèl; <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>men sila yo ki ranpli ak anbisyon pèsonèl e ki pa obeyi verite a, men ki obeyisan sèlman a lenjistis, ap twouve lakòlè ak lendiyasyon Bondye. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Va genyen tribilasyon ak gran doulè pou tout nanm pami lòm ki fè mechanste <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:16">Wo 1:16</ref></char></note>premyèman pou Jwif la, men osi pou Grèk la.<verse eid="ROM 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:7">Wo 2:7</ref></char></note>laglwa, lonè ak lapè pou tout moun ki fè byen, premyèman pou Jwif la, men osi pou Grèk la. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>Paske avèk Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Det 10:17</ref></char></note>pa gen patipri. <verse eid="ROM 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Paske tout moun ki fè peche <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:23">Trav 2:23</ref></char></note>san Lalwa a va peri osi san Lalwa a, e tout moun ki fè peche anba Lalwa a va jije pa Lalwa a. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Paske se pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:21">Mat 7:21</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:24">24</ref></char></note>sila ki tande Lalwa a ki jis devan Bondye, men se sila ki obeyi Lalwa a ki jistifye. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Paske lè pèp etranje yo ki pa gen Lalwa a, fè pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:35">Trav 10:35</ref></char></note>ensten sa ke Lalwa a mande, sila yo, san menm gen lalwa a, vini yon lwa pou kont yo. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Konsa yo demontre ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:14">Wo 2:14</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 2:27">27</ref></char></note>zèv Lalwa yo se byen ekri nan kè yo. Se pwòp konsyans yo ki bay temwayaj, epi panse yo, pafwa ap bay kondanasyon e pafwa ap defann yo. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Nan jou sa a selon levanjil mwen an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:42">Trav 10:42</ref></char></note>Bondye ap jije tout sekrè a lèzòm selon Jésus Kri.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Men si nou pote tit “Jwif”, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 3:11">Mi 3:11</ref></char></note>depann de Lalwa, e vante tèt nou nan Bondye, <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>konnen volonte Li, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:10">Fil 1:10</ref></char></note>vin dakò avèk tout bagay ki nesesè, paske se nou menm ki enstwi selon Lalwa a, <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>si nou rete byen si ke nou menm se gid avèg yo, yon limyè pou sila ki nan tenèb yo, <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>yon korektè pou ensanse yo, yon pwofesè pou sila ki poko gen matirite yo, akoz ke nou gen Lalwa a kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:31">Wo 3:31</ref></char></note>vrè baz konesans ak verite a; <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>konsa, nou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:3">Mat 23:3</ref></char></note>ki enstwi lòt yo, èske nou pa enstwi pwòp tèt nou? Nou menm ki preche ke yon moun pa dwe vòlè, èske nou vòlè? <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Nou menm ki di ke yon moun pa dwe fè adiltè, èske nou fè adiltè? Nou menm ki rayi zidòl yo, èske nou konn vòlè tanp yo? <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Nou menm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 3:11">Mi 3:11</ref></char></note>vante tèt nou nan Lalwa a, malgre nou vyole Lalwa a, èske nou dezonore Bondye? <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Paske jan sa ekri a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">És 52:5</ref></char></note>“Non Bondye a blasfeme pa etranje yo akoz de nou”. <verse eid="ROM 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Paske anverite, sikonsizyon gen valè si nou ap pratike Lalwa a, men si nou se yon transgresè Lalwa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:4">Jr 4:4</ref></char></note>sikonsizyon sa a gen tan vini ensikonsizyon. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 7:19">I Kwo 7:19</ref></char></note>Donk, si yon nonm ki pa fizikman sikonsi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:4">Wo 8:4</ref></char></note>swiv tout règleman Lalwa yo, èske ensikonsizyon li an pa konsidere kòm sikonsizyon? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Epi li menm ki pa sikonsi fizikman, si li gade lalwa a, èske li p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:41">Mat 12:41</ref></char></note>jije nou, ki malgre nou gen chak lèt lalwa a ak sikonsizyon, se vyolatè lalwa a? <verse eid="ROM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:39">Jn 8:39</ref></char></note>sa ki fè yon moun Jwif se pa sa ki parèt deyò a. Ni vrè sikonizyon an se pa sa ki fèt nan chè eksteryè a. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Men yon vrè Jwif se sila ki sikonsi pa anndan. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:6">Det 30:6</ref></char></note>Sikonsizyon an se sa ki fèt nan kè, pa Lespri Sen an, men pa selon lèt lalwa a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:44">Jn 5:44</ref></char></note>Lwanj pa li pa sòti nan lòm, men nan Bondye.<verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Konsa, ki avantaj Jwif la genyen? Oubyen ki benefis sikonsizyon genyen? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Anpil nan tout aspè. Premyèman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:8">Det 4:8</ref></char></note>Jwif yo te konfye avèk tout pawòl ki sòti nan bouch Bondye yo. <verse eid="ROM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Answit kisa? Si <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:16">Wo 10:16</ref></char></note>kèk pa t kwè, enkwayans pa yo p ap chanje fidelite Bondye anvè yo. Se pa sa? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Ke sa pa janm fèt! Olye de sa, annou ensiste ke Bondye toujou vrè, malgre tout moun se mantè, jan sa ekri a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">Sòm 51:4</ref></char></note>“Ke Ou kapab jistifye nan pawòl Ou yo, e Ou kapab gen rezon lè Ou jije.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Men si enjistis nou montre jistis Bondye, kisa nou kapab di? Èske Bondye ki dechennen lakòlè Li a, enjis? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:19">Wo 6:19</ref></char></note>(M ap pale tankou yon moun)? <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Ke sa pa janm fèt! Otreman, kòman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:16">Wo 2:16</ref></char></note>Bondye va jije lemond? <verse eid="ROM 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Men si akoz manti pa m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:4">Wo 3:4</ref></char></note>verite Bondye a vin parèt jis pou glwa Li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:19">Wo 9:19</ref></char></note>poukisa yo toujou jije m kòm yon pechè? <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Epi poukisa nou pa di (jan kèk ènmi konn di n ap di a): <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:1">Wo 6:1</ref></char></note>“Annou fè mal pou byen kapab soti?” Kondanasyon pa yo jis. <verse eid="ROM 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Kisa answit? Èske nou pi bon pase yo? Paditou! Paske nou deja di ke ni Jwif ni Grèk, toude koupab anba peche. <verse eid="ROM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>Jan sa ekri a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Sòm 14:1-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Pa gen moun ki jis, pa menm youn.<verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>Pa gen moun ki gen konprann.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:11">Pa gen moun ki chache Bondye.<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Tout detounen, ansanm yo tout vin initil.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">Pa gen moun ki fè sa ki bon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">pa menm yon sèl.<verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 5:9">Sòm 5:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gòj pa yo se yon tonm tou louvri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Avèk lang pa yo, yo miltipliye desepsyon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 140:3">Sòm 140:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pwazon sèpan aspik rete anba lèv yo.<verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:7">Sòm 10:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bouch yo anmè nèt e plen ak madichon;<verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:7">És 59:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>pye yo kouri rapid pou fè san koule.<verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>Destriksyon ak mizè toujou rete sou wout yo;<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>epi chemen k ap mennen lapè a, yo pa konnen l.<verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 36:1">Sòm 36:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nanpwen lakrent Bondye devan zye yo.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>Alò, nou konnen ke nenpòt sa ke Lalwa a di, li pale ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:12">Wo 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:9">Wo 3:9</ref></char></note>sila ki anba Lalwa yo, pou tout bouch kapab fèmen e pou tout mond lan kapab vin responsab devan Bondye. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 142:3">Sòm 142:3</ref></char></note>pa zèv Lalwa a, pa gen chè k ap jistifye nan zye Li; paske selon Lalwa a, vini konesans peche.<verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Men koulye a, apa Lalwa sa a, nou wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:17">Wo 1:17</ref></char></note>ladwati Bondye byen parèt pa yon temwayaj konplè de Lalwa ak pwofèt yo. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>Se ladwati Bondye a menm atravè lafwa nan Jésus Kri pou tout sila ki kwè yo, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:12">Wo 10:12</ref></char></note>pa gen patipri. <verse eid="ROM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>Paske tout moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:9">Wo 3:9</ref></char></note> peche e yo tonbe kout de laglwa Bondye a. <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>Men Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:4">Wo 4:4</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 4:16">16</ref></char></note>jistifye kòm yon kado pa gras Li atravè redanmsyon ki nan Jésus Kri a, <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Li menm ke Bondye te fè parèt piblikman kòm yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:2">I Jn 2:2</ref></char></note>viktim ekspiyatwa nan san Li atravè lafwa. Li te fè sa pou montre jistis Li. Akoz pasyans Li, Bondye pa t kontwole peche ki te fèt deja yo. <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>Sa te fèt pou Li montre nou ladwati li nan tan prezan an, e pou Li ta nan menm lè a, devni Sila ki jistifye sila ki gen fwa nan Jésus yo.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 2:17">Wo 2:17</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 2:23">23</ref></char>
    </note>Ki kote konsa nou kapab vante tèt nou? Sa pa la ankò! Pa ki kalite lwa? Pa lalwa a zèv yo? Non, men pa lalwa a lafwa a. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:39">Trav 13:39</ref></char></note>nou ensiste ke yon moun jistifye pa lafwa, apa de tout zèv Lalwa yo. <verse eid="ROM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Oubyen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:34">Trav 10:34</ref></char></note>èske Bondye se sèlman pou Jwif yo? Èske Li pa Bondye pèp etranje yo tou? Wi pèp etranje yo ladann tou. <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>Anfèt akoz Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:22">Wo 3:22</ref></char></note>ki va jistifye sikonsi pa lafwa yo, ak ensikonsi selon lafwa yo, se yon sèl.<verse eid="ROM 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Konsa, èske nou detwi Lalwa a ak lafwa? Ke sa pa janm fèt! Okontrè, se konsa nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:17">Mat 5:17</ref></char></note>etabli Lalwa a.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Konsa kisa nou kapab di ke Abraham, zansèt nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:3">Wo 1:3</ref></char></note>selon lachè te jwenn kon jijman? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Paske si Abraham te jistifye pa zèv, li gen yon bagay pou vante tèt li, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 1:31">I Kwo 1:31</ref></char></note>pa devan Bondye. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Paske kisa Ekriti Sen Yo di?: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Jen 15:6</ref></char></note> “Abraham te kwè Bondye e sa te konte kòm ladwati li.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Alò, nou konnen ke sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:6">Wo 11:6</ref></char></note>travay la, salè li pa konte kòm yon favè, men kòm sa li merite. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Men pou sila ki pa travay la, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:29">Jn 6:29</ref></char></note>kwè nan Sila ki jistifye pechè yo, lafwa li ap konte kòm ladwati li. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Menm jan ke David te pale tou sou benediksyon ki vini sou moun ke Bondye deklare jis apa de zèv li yo:<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:1">Sòm 32:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Beni se tout moun ki gen tan padone pou tout inikite yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:7">e ke peche pa yo gen tan fin kouvri.<verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:2">Sòm 32:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Beni se moun Senyè a pa rann kont pou peche l.”<verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Konsa èske benediksyon sa a sou sikonsi sèlman, oubyen èske li tonbe sou ensikonsi yo tou? Paske nou di ke: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Jen 15:6</ref></char></note>“Lafwa a te konte a Abraham kòm ladwati li.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Konsa kòman sa te konte? Pandan li te sikonsi, oubyen pandan li te ensikonsi a? Se pa t pandan li te sikonsi a, men lè li te ensikonsi a! <verse eid="ROM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Jen 17:10</ref></char></note>resevwa sign sikonsisyon an, kòm yon so ladwati li ke li te genyen pandan li te ensikonsi a, pou li ta kapab vin papa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:22">Wo 3:22</ref></char></note>tout sila ki kwè, menm sa yo san sikonsisyon, pou ladwati kapab konte pou yo. <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>Li se papa a sikonsizyon, non sèlman pou sila ki sikonsi yo, men osi a sila yo ki swiv chemen lafwa ke Abraham te genyen pandan li te ensikonsi a.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Paske pwomès a Abraham ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-6">Jen 17:4-6</ref></char></note>desandan li yo pou li te kab resevwa tout lemond kòm eritaj, pa t fèt selon lalwa, men selon ladwati lafwa a. <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:8">Gal 3:8</ref></char></note>si se sila ki gen Lalwa a k ap eritye, lafwa vin pa vo anyen e pwomès la vin anile. <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>Paske Lalwa a pote lakòlè, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:20">Wo 3:20</ref></char></note>kote ki pa gen lalwa, pa gen vyolasyon.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Pou rezon sa a, se pa lafwa, pou li ta kapab pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:24">Wo 3:24</ref></char></note>gras, ke pwomès la ta kapab asire a tout desandan Abraham yo; non sèlman a sila ki gen Lalwa a, men osi a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:7">Gal 3:7</ref></char></note>sila ki gen lafwa Abraham nan, ki se papa a nou tout. <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>Jan sa ekri a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Jen 17:5</ref></char></note>“Mwen te fè ou Papa a anpil nasyon yo”, devan Sila a ke li (Abraham) te kwè a. Sa vle di, menm Bondye ki bay lavi a mò yo e ki fè egziste tout sila ki pa t janm egziste oparavan yo. <verse eid="ROM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Nan espwa kont tout esperans li te kwè, pou li ta kapab vin papa a anpil nasyon, selon sa ki te pale a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Jen 15:5</ref></char></note>“Se konsa tout desandan ou yo va ye”. <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>San li pa t vin fèb nan lafwa, li te reflechi sou pwòp kò li, ki te gen tan prèske mouri paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Jen 17:17</ref></char></note>li te gen anviwon san lane e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:11">Jen 18:11</ref></char></note>vant Sarah a te esteril akoz laj li.<verse eid="ROM 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>Men, selon pwomès a Bondye a, li pa t varye menm nan konfyans li, men te vin fò nan lafwa e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:8">Mat 9:8</ref></char></note>te toujou bay Bondye lwanj. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:5">Wo 14:5</ref></char></note>Li te gen asirans konplè ke sa Bondye te pwomèt la, Li ta kapab fè l rive. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Donk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Jen 15:6</ref></char></note>sa te konte osi pou li kòm ladwati. <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:4">Wo 15:4</ref></char></note>pa t sèlman pou lakoz li sèl ke yo te ekri ke sa te konte pou li, <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>men anplis pou nou osi sa te konte, kòm sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:9">Wo 10:9</ref></char></note>ki kwè nan Li yo; Li menm ki te resisite Jésus Kri, Senyè nou an sòti nan lanmò. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>Li menm ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">És 53:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55">55</ref></char></note>livre a lakwa a pou peche nou yo e te resisite pou jistifikasyon nou.<verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 3:28">Wo 3:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, akoz ke nou jistifye pa lafwa, nou gen lapè avèk Bondye atravè Senyè nou an Jésus Kri. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>Selon Li menm tou pa lafwa, nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:18">Ef 2:18</ref></char></note>twouve aksè a gras sa a ki fè nou kanpe fèm. Epi nou rejwi nan esperans laglwa Bondye a. <verse eid="ROM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Pa sèlman sa, men nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:12">Mat 5:12</ref></char></note>rejwi nan tribilasyon nou yo, paske nou konnen ke tribilasyon sa a pote pèseverans. <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>E pèseverans fè bon karaktè, e bon karaktè, esperans. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>Epi esperans <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:116">Sòm 119:116</ref></char></note>p ap janm fè nou desi, paske lanmou Bondye gen tan vide nan kè nou atravè Lespri Sen a ki te bay a nou menm nan.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Paske pandan nou te ankò san defans, nan moman an menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:25">Wo 4:25</ref></char></note>Kris te mouri pou sila ki te san Bondye yo. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Se pa fasil ke yon nonm ta mouri pou yon moun ki jis, men petèt pou yon bon moun, li ta kab gen kouraj pou mouri. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Men Bondye montre tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16">Jn 3:16</ref></char></note>lanmou li anvè nou, ke pandan nou te ankò pechè, Kris te mouri pou nou.<verse eid="ROM 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Anplis ke sa, akoz ke nou gen tan jistifye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:25">Wo 3:25</ref></char></note>pa san li, nou va sove <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:18">Wo 1:18</ref></char></note>de lakòlè Bondye a atravè Li menm. <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Paske, si pandan nou te ankò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:28">Wo 11:28</ref></char></note>lènmi, nou te rekonsilye a Bondye pa lanmò a Fis Li a, anplis ke sa, akoz nou gen tan rekonsilye, nou va sove pa lavi Li.<verse eid="ROM 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Epi pa sèlman sa, men osi nou rejwi nan Bondye atravè Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri. Atravè Li menm nou gen tan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:10">Wo 5:10</ref></char></note>rekonsilye. <verse eid="ROM 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Pou sa, se konsa pa yon sèl moun peche te antre nan lemonn, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:23">Wo 6:23</ref></char></note>lanmò pa peche a, konsa lanmò te rive a tout moun paske tout moun fè peche. <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Paske jiska Lalwa a te rive, peche <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:15">Wo 4:15</ref></char></note>te deja nan lemonn, men peche pa t kapab resevwa jijman kote ki pa gen lalwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Malgre sa, lanmò te renye soti nan Adam jiska Moïse, menm sou sila ki pa t fè peche yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:7">Os 6:7</ref></char></note>sanblab ak ofans Adam an, ki se te yon pòtre a Sila ki te gen pou vini an.<verse eid="ROM 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Men kado gratis la pa sanble avèk transgresyon an. Paske si akoz transgresyon a yon sèl moun, anpil moun te mouri, menm bokou plis ke sa, lagras Bondye, ak kado pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:11">Trav 15:11</ref></char></note>lagras a yon sèl òm, Jésus Kri, vin jistifye anpil moun. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Kado a se pa tankou sila ki te vini pa moun ki te peche a; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:32">I Kor 11:32</ref></char></note>jijman an te sòti nan yon sèl transgresyon ki te bay rezilta a kondanasyon, men kado gratis la, ki te soti akoz anpil transgresyon yo, te bay kon rezilta a, jistifikasyon. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Paske si pa transgresyon a yon moun, lanmò te renye akoz li menm, bokou plis ke sa, sila ki resevwa gras an abondans ak kado ladwati a, ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:12">II Tim 2:12</ref></char></note>renye nan lavi atravè Li menm, Jésus Kri.<verse eid="ROM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Konsa, kòm pa yon transgresyon, kondanasyon a tout moun te rive, menm jan an ak yon sèl aksyon ladwati te rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:25">Wo 4:25</ref></char></note>jistifikasyon anvè lavi pou tout moun. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Paske menm jan ke dezobeyisans a yon moun te fè tout moun vin pechè, menm jan an, obeyisans a yon moun va fè anpil moun vin jis. <verse eid="ROM 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Lalwa a te vini pou transgresyon an te kapab vin plis, men kote peche te vin plis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:1">Wo 6:1</ref></char></note>lagras te abonde pi plis toujou. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Konsa, menm jan ke peche te renye nan lanmò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:17">Jn 1:17</ref></char></note>konsa tou lagras te renye pa ladwati, jiska lavi etènèl nan Jésus Kri Senyè nou an.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Konsa, Kisa nou kapab di? Èske n ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:8">Wo 3:8</ref></char></note>kontinye nan peche pou lagras kapab vin plis? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Ke sa pa janm fèt! Kijan nou menm ki te mouri a peche nou kapab kontinye viv nan li? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Oubyen èske nou pa konnen ke nou tout ki batize nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:38">Trav 2:38</ref></char></note>Kris Jésus a, gen tan batize nan lanmò li? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Konsa, nou gen tan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:12">Kol 2:12</ref></char></note>antere avèk Li pa batèm nan lanmò Li a, pouke menm jan Kris te leve soti vivan nan lanmò a pa laglwa a Papa a, nou osi kapab mache nan nouvèl vi a.<verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 2:10">II Kor 2:10</ref></char></note>si nou vin sanble avèk Li nan lanmò Li, n ap vin sanble avèk Li nan rezirèksyon Li tou. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Byen rekonesan ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Ef 4:22</ref></char></note>ansyen moun nou an te krisifye avèk Li, pouke kò peche nou an ta kapab vin disparèt pou nou kab pa esklav a peche ankò. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>Paske sila ki gen tan mouri an, libere de peche. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Wo 6:4</ref></char></note>si nou gen tan mouri avèk Kris, nou kwè osi ke n ap viv avèk Li. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Paske nou konnen ke Kris ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:24">Trav 2:24</ref></char></note>leve soti nan lanmò a, p ap janm mouri ankò. Lanmò pa mèt Li ankò. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>Paske lanmò ke Li te mouri an, Li te mouri anvè peche, yon fwa pou tout, men vi ke L ap viv la, L ap viv pou Bondye. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Menm jan konsidere nou menm kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:2">Wo 6:2</ref></char></note>mò ak peche, men vivan anvè Bondye nan Jésus Kri.<verse eid="ROM 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Konsa, pa kite peche <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:14">Wo 6:14</ref></char></note>reye nan kò mòtèl nou an, pou nou ta obeyi tout mal dezi li yo. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Pa kontinye ofri manm kò nou a peche kòm enstriman a lenjistis, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:1">Wo 12:1</ref></char></note>prezante nou menm a Bondye kòm moun ki deja vivan soti nan lanmò, e manm kò nou a Bondye kòm enstriman ladwati. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:6">Wo 8:6</ref></char></note>peche pa dwe mèt nou, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:4">Wo 7:4</ref></char></note>nou pa anba Lalwa, men anba gras.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Kisa Ankò? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:1">Wo 6:1</ref></char></note>Èske n ap fè peche paske nou pa anba Lalwa, men anba gras? Ke sa pa janm fèt! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Èske nou pa konnen ke lè nou livre tèt nou a yon moun kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:34">Jn 8:34</ref></char></note>esklav obeyisan, nou vin esklav a sila ke nou obeyi a; swa a peche ki bay kòm rezilta lanmò, oubyen a obeyisans ki bay kòm rezilta ladwati? <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Men mèsi Bondye, malgre nou te esklav a peche, nou te vin obeyisan nan kè nou a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:13">II Tim 1:13</ref></char></note>menm doktrin ke nou te resevwa a. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Epi lè nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:32">Jn 8:32</ref></char></note>libere de peche, nou te vin esklav a ladwati.<verse eid="ROM 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>M ap pale nan tèm a moun, akoz feblès lachè nou. Paske menm jan avan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:13">Wo 6:13</ref></char></note>ke nou te konn prezante manm kò nou kòm esklav a salte ak linikite, ki te bay kòm rezilta, plis linikite toujou, koulye a prezante yo kòm esklav a ladwati ki bay kòm rezilta, sanktifikasyon. <verse eid="ROM 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat 6:24</ref></char></note>lè nou te esklav de peche a, nou te lib de sa ki konsène ladwati. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Donk Ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:13">Jr 12:13</ref></char></note>benefis nou te twouve konsa ki soti nan bagay yo ki fè nou wont koulye a? Paske sa ki soti nan bagay sa yo se lanmò. <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Men koulye a ke nou gen tan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:32">Jn 8:32</ref></char></note>fin lib de peche, e vin esklav a Bondye, nou twouve benefis nou ki bay kòm benefis sanktifikasyon, e kòm rezilta, lavi etènèl. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Paske salè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:16">Wo 6:16</ref></char></note>peche se lanmò, men kado gratis Bondye a, se lavi etènèl nan Jésus Kri, Senyè nou an.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Oubyen èske nou pa konnen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:13">Wo 1:13</ref></char></note>frè m yo, (m ap pale avèk sila ki konnen Lalwa yo), ke Lalwa gen pouvwa sou yon moun pandan tout tan ke li vivan? <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Paske yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 7:39">I Kwo 7:39</ref></char></note>fanm ki marye vin mare pa lalwa a mari li pandan mari li vivan, men si mari li mouri, fanm nan vin lib de lalwa ak sa ki konsène mari li a. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Kidonk, si li vin jwenn yon lòt gason pandan mari li vivan an, yo va rele li yon adiltè, men si mari a mouri, li va lib de lwa a pou li pa yon adiltè, malgre li jwenn yon lòt gason. <verse eid="ROM 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Donk Frè m yo, nou menm tou nan kò Kris la, nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:6">Wo 7:6</ref></char></note>oblije mouri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:19">Gal 2:19</ref></char></note>a Lalwa a pou nou te kapab vin jwenn yon lòt, a Sila ki te leve soti nan lanmò a pou nou menm ta kapab pote fwi pou Bondye. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Paske pandan nou te nan lachè, Lalwa a te fè move pasyon yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:7">Wo 7:7</ref></char></note>leve nan nou, ki t ap travay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:13">Wo 6:13</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 6:21">21</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 6:23">23</ref></char></note>nan manm kò nou yo, pou donnen fwi pou lanmò. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Men koulye a nou gen tan fin lage de lwa sa a. Kòmsi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:2">Wo 6:2</ref></char></note>nou te mouri de sa ki te mare nou an e koulye a nou sèvi yon lòt jan avèk yon Lespri de nouvo, e pa nan lansyen sistèm a lèt lalwa a.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Donk kisa nou kapab di? Èske Lalwa se peche? Pa janm kite nou panse sa! Okontrè, mwen pa t ap konnen peche sof ke Lalwa te montre m li. Mwen pa t ap konnen anyen sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Egz 20:17</ref></char></note>“lanvi” si se pa Lalwa ki di m “Ou pa pou gen lanvi”. <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Men peche, ki te pran opòtinite atravè<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:20">Wo 3:20</ref></char></note>Lalwa a, te prodwi nan mwen lanvi de tout kalite; paske san Lalwa a, peche mouri. <verse eid="ROM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Yon fwa, mwen te vivan separe de Lalwa a, men lè kòmandman an te vini, peche te pran lavi, e mwen te mouri. <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>Konsa, kòmandman sa a ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref></char></note>fèt pou bay lavi a, te bay lanmò kòm rezilta pou mwen. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Paske peche, ki te pran opòtinite pa kòmandman an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:13">Jen 3:13</ref></char></note>te twonpe mwen e akoz sa, te touye mwen. <verse eid="ROM 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:16">Wo 7:16</ref></char></note>Alò, konsa Lalwa a sen, e kòmandman an sen, jis e bon.<verse eid="ROM 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Donk èske li posib ke sa ki te bon ta devni kòz lanmò mwen? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 20:16">Luc 20:16</ref></char></note>Ke nou pa janm panse sa! Olye de sa, se te peche ki te fè sa a, pou li ta fè m wè sa ke peche ye. Konsa li te fè m mouri ak sa ki bon an, pouke selon kòmandman an, li ta montre m kijan peche kondane nan nivo ki piwo a. <verse eid="ROM 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Paske nou konnen ke Lalwa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 3:1">I Kwo 3:1</ref></char></note>baze sou lespri Bondye a menm. Men mwen menm se chè. Mwen te vann kòm esklav a peche. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Paske sa ke m ap fè yo, mwen pa konprann yo. Mwen p ap pratike <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:19">Wo 7:19</ref></char></note>sa ke m ta renmen fè, men m ap fè bagay ke m rayi. <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Men si m fè bagay m pito pa vle fè a, mwen vin dakò avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:12">Wo 7:12</ref></char></note>Lalwa a, e admèt ke Lalwa a bon. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Donk Koulye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:20">Wo 7:20</ref></char></note>se pa mwen k ap fè l la ankò, men se peche ki rete nan mwen an. <verse eid="ROM 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Paske mwen konnen ke anyen ki bon pa rete nan mwen, sa vle di nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:6">Jn 3:6</ref></char></note>chè mwen. Paske bòn volonte a prezan nan mwen, men pou fè sa ki bon an pa janm fèt. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:15">Wo 7:15</ref></char></note>Paske bon bagay ke mwen vle a, mwen pa janm fè li, men mwen pratike menm mal ke m pi pa vle a. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Men si mwen ap fè menm bagay ke m pi pa vle a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:17">Wo 7:17</ref></char></note>mwen pa moun k ap fè l la ankò, men se peche ki rete nan mwen an. <verse eid="ROM 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Donk, mwen twouve kòm<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:23">Wo 7:23</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 7:25">25</ref></char></note>prensip ke mal toujou prezan nan mwen, mwen menm ki vle fè sa ki bon an. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Paske, plen ak lajwa, mwen vin dakò avèk Lalwa Bondye ki aji <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 4:16">II Kwo 4:16</ref></char></note>andedan an, <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>men nan manm kò mwen, mwen wè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:19">Wo 6:19</ref></char></note>lòt lwa k ap goumen kont Lalwa volonte lespri mwen an e k ap fè m prizonye lwa peche ki nan manm mwen yo. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Moun mizerab ke mwen ye! Ki moun k ap libere m soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:6">Wo 6:6</ref></char></note>kò lanmò sa a? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Mèsi a Bondye atravè Jésus Kri Senyè nou an! Konsa, yon kote, nan panse m, m ap sèvi Lalwa Bondye a. Men yon lòt kote, avèk chè mwen, m ap sèvi lalwa peche a.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Konsa nanpwen okenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:34">Wo 8:34</ref></char></note>kondanasyon pou sila ki nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:9">Wo 8:9</ref></char></note>Kris Jésus yo, ki pa mache selon lachè a, men selon Lespri a. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Paske lalwa Lespri lavi a nan Jésus Kri te libere nou de Lalwa peche ak lanmò a. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:39">Trav 13:39</ref></char></note>sa ke Lalwa a pa t kab fè akoz feblès li anvè lachè a, Bondye te fè l lè Li te voye pwòp Fis li menm nan imaj a chè peche a, kòm yon ofrann pou peche. Konsa, Li te kondane peche nan lachè, <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>pou tout egzijans Lalwa a ta kapab akonpli nan nou menm, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:16">Gal 5:16</ref>,<ref loc="GAL 5:25">25</ref></char></note>pa mache ankò selon lachè, men selon Lespri a. <verse eid="ROM 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Paske sila ki viv selon lachè yo konsantre panse yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:19-21">Gal 5:19-21</ref></char></note>tout bagay ki konsène lachè a, men sila ki viv selon Lespri a, konsantre panse yo sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:22-25">Gal 5:22-25</ref></char></note>tout bagay Lespri yo. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:8">Gal 6:8</ref></char></note>Paske panse ki konsantre sou lachè a se lanmò, men panse ki konsantre sou Lespri a se lavi ak lapè. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Konsa, panse ki konsantre sou lachè se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:4">Jc 4:4</ref></char></note>lènmi a Bondye, paske li pa soumèt tèt li a Lalwa Bondye. Paske li pa posib pou lachè a fè sa. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Konsa, sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:5">Wo 7:5</ref></char></note>nan lachè yo pa kapab fè Bondye plezi.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Men nou pa nan lachè a, men nan Lespri a, si vrèman Lespri Bondye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:23">Jn 14:23</ref></char></note>rete nan nou. Men si yon moun pa gen Lespri Kris la, li pa moun pa L. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:23">Jn 17:23</ref></char></note>Si Kris nan nou, malgre kò a mouri akoz peche, lespri a ap viv akoz ladwati Bondye. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>Men si Lespri de Li menm ki te resisite Jésus nan lanmò a rete nan nou, Li menm ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:24">Trav 2:24</ref></char></note>fè Jésus Kri leve soti nan lanmò a ap bay lavi a kò mòtèl nou an pa Lespri Li ki rete andedan nou an.<verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Konsa, frè m yo, nou pa anba obligasyon lachè a, pou viv selon lachè. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Paske si nou ap viv selon lachè, nou ap mouri, men si se selon Lespri a, n ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:5">Kol 3:5</ref></char></note>mete tout zèv lachè yo a lanmò, e n ap viv. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Paske, tout moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:18">Gal 5:18</ref></char></note>ki ap dirije pa Lespri Sen Bondye a, se fis Li yo ye. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Paske nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:15">Eb 2:15</ref></char></note>pa t resevwa yon Lespri esklavaj, pou fè nou retounen viv nan laperèz, men nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:23">Wo 8:23</ref></char></note>te resevwa yon Lespri adopsyon kon fis. Pa lespri sila nou rele “Abba! Papa a.<verse eid="ROM 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Lespri a Li menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:32">Trav 5:32</ref></char></note>temwaye a lespri pa nou ke nou se pitit Bondye. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Si se pitit li nou ye, n ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:32">Trav 20:32</ref></char></note>eritye tou. N ap eritye de Bondye e eritye ansanm avèk Kris, si vrèman nou soufri avè l pou nou kapab vin gen glwa ansanm avè l.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Paske, mwen konsidere soufrans lan nan tan sa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 4:17">II Kwo 4:17</ref></char></note>pa kapab konpare menm avèk laglwa ki va revele a nou menm nan. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Paske tout kreyasyon an ap tann avèk gwo lanvi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:18">Wo 8:18</ref></char></note>revelasyon a fis Bondye yo. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Paske kreyasyon an te a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-19">Jen 3:17-19</ref></char></note>sibi anba <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 39:5">Sòm 39:5</ref></char></note>kòve, pa selon pwòp volonte pa li, men akoz Bondye ki te fè l soumèt, nan esperans lan; <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:21">Trav 3:21</ref></char></note>kreyasyon an li menm osi va libere soti nan esklavaj a koripsyon, pou l antre nan libète laglwa a fis Bondye yo. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Paske nou konnen ke jis nan lè sa a tout kreyasyon ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:4">Jr 12:4</ref>,<ref loc="JER 12:11">11</ref></char></note>leve vwa li nan gwo plent tankou fanm k ap fè pitit. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Epi se pa sèlman sa, men nou menm osi ki gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:16">Wo 8:16</ref></char></note>premye fwi Lespri yo, menm nou menm, nou plenyen menm jan an anndan nou, pandan n ap tann adopsyon nou kòm fis, ak redanmsyon a kò mòtèl nou an. <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Paske nou te sove nan espwa, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:18">Wo 4:18</ref></char></note>espwa a yon bagay nou kapab wè se pa espwa. Poukisa yon moun ta espere yon bagay ke li wè deja? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 1:3">I Tes 1:3</ref></char></note>si nou espere sa ke nou pa wè, nou ap tann li avèk gwo lanvi ak pèseverans.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Menm jan an, Lespri a ede nou tou nan feblès nou; paske nou pa konnen kòman pou nou priye jan nou ta dwe priye a. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:16">Jn 14:16</ref></char></note>Lespri a Li menm entèsede pou nou avèk soupi ki pa kapab eksprime. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 139:1">Sòm 139:1</ref></char></note>Li menm ki sonde kè yo konnen panse a Lespri a, paske Li entèsede pou tout sen yo selon volonte Bondye a.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Konsa nou konnen ke Bondye fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:32">Wo 8:32</ref></char></note>tout bagay mache ansanm pou byen a sila ki renmen Bondye yo, pou sila ke Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:30">Wo 8:30</ref></char></note>rele selon volonte Li yo. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Paske sila ke Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:12">Wo 11:12</ref></char></note>konnen oparavan yo, Li te chwazi yo depi avan pou vin konfòm a limaj a Fis Li a, pou Li ta kapab premye ne pami anpil frè. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Epi sila ke Li te chwazi oparavan yo, Li te anplis rele yo, e sila Li te rele yo, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:11">I Kwo 6:11</ref></char></note>jistifye yo, e sila Li te jistifye yo, anplis, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:22">Jn 17:22</ref></char></note>glorifye yo.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Konsa, kisa nou kapab di de bagay sa yo? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Sòm 118:6</ref></char></note>Si Bondye pou nou, kilès ki kab kont nou? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>Li menm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16">Jn 3:16</ref></char></note>pa t epagne pwòp Fis Li, men te livre Li pou nou tout, kijan Li ta refize bay nou tout bagay tou? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Kilès k ap pote yon akizasyon kont sila ke Bondye chwazi yo? Se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:8">És 50:8</ref></char></note>Bondye menm ki fè moun jis. <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Kilès ki k ap kondane? Se Jésus Kri ki te mouri pou nou an, wi, pito di ki te leve a, ki rete sou men dwat Bondye, e ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:27">Wo 8:27</ref></char></note>ap entèsede pou nou tou.<verse eid="ROM 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Kilès k ap separe nou de lanmou Kris la? Èske se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 4:8">II Kwo 4:8</ref></char></note>tribilasyon, soufrans <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 4:11">I Kwo 4:11</ref></char></note>pèsekisyon, grangou, toutouni, gwo danje, oubyen nepe? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Jan sa ekri a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 44:22">Sòm 44:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Pou kòz pa w, yo mete nou a lanmò tout lajounen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">Nou te konsidere kòm mouton ki prè pou kòche.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Men, nan tout bagay, nou plis ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:33">Jn 16:33</ref></char></note>venkè atravè Sila a ki renmen nou an. <verse eid="ROM 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Paske mwen konvenk ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 3:22">I Kwo 3:22</ref></char></note>ni lanmò, ni lavi, ni zanj yo, ni wayòm yo, ni bagay k ap pase koulye a, ni bagay k ap vini pi devan, ni pouvwa yo <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>ni wotè, ni pwofondè, ni lòt bagay ki kreye, pa kapab separe nou de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:8">Wo 5:8</ref></char></note>lanmou Bondye, ki nan Kris Jésus, Senyè nou an.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 11:10">II Kwo 11:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>M ap di nou verite nan Kris la, mwen p ap bay manti. Konsyans mwen temwaye pou mwen nan Lespri Sen an, <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>ke mwen gen yon gran tristès ak doulè san rete nan kè mwen. <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Paske mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:32">Egz 32:32</ref></char></note>te kab vle ke se mwen menm ki te kondane, separe de Kris pou lanmou frè m yo, fanmi mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:14">Wo 11:14</ref></char></note>selon lachè. <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>Yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:22">Egz 4:22</ref></char></note>Izrayelit ki te resevwa adopsyon kòm fis yo, ak laglwa akò yo, don Lalwa a, sèvis nan tanp lan, ak tout pwomès yo; <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>ki gen patriyach yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:1-16">Mat 1:1-16</ref></char></note>ki se zansèt a Kris la selon lachè; Li menm ki sou tout bagay, Bondye beni pou tout tan an. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Men se pa kòmsi pawòl Bondye a fè fayit. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:28">Wo 2:28</ref></char></note>Paske se pa yo tout ki Izrayelit ki sòti nan ras Israël, <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:23">Jn 8:23</ref></char></note>se pa tout pitit ki sòti nan Abraham ki se pitit li. Men: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Jen 21:12</ref></char></note>“Selon Isaac desandan ou yo va nonmen”. <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Sa vle di, se pa zanfan lachè yo ki se pitit Bondye, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:13">Wo 4:13</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 4:16">16</ref></char></note>zanfan a pwomès la ki konsidere kòm erityè yo. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>Paske men pawòl a pwomès la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Jen 18:10</ref></char></note>“Nan moman apwente a, m ap vini e Sarah va gen yon fis.” <verse eid="ROM 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Epi se pa sèlman sa, men te gen<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:21">Jen 25:21</ref></char></note>Rebecca osi, lè li te fè jimo yo pou yon sèl moun, Isaac, papa nou. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:17">Wo 4:17</ref></char></note>malgre jimo yo potko fèt e potko fè anyen ni byen ni mal, pou volonte Bondye selon chwa li ta kanpe, pa akoz zèv yo, men akoz Li menm, Bondye, ki fè apèl la, <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/>Li te di a Rebecca: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Jen 25:23</ref></char></note>“Pi gran an va sèvi pi piti a”. <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>Jan sa ekri a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:2">Mal 1:2</ref></char></note>“Jacob Mwen te renmen an, men Ésaü mwen te rayi a”.<verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Ki sa nou kapab di konsa? Èske gen lenjistis avèk Bondye? Fòk nou konprann sa pa janm fèt! <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Paske Li di a Moïse: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Egz 33:19</ref></char></note>“Mwen va bay mizerikòd a sila ke m vle bay mizerikòd, e konpasyon pou sa ke m vle gen konpasyon.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Konsa, sa pa depann de moun ki vle a oubyen moun ki kouri a, men de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:8">Ef 2:8</ref></char></note>Bondye ki vle bay mizerikòd la. <verse eid="ROM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Egz 9:16</ref></char></note>Lekriti a di a Farawon: “Pou rezon sa a menm, Mwen te leve ou, pou montre pouvwa Mwen nan ou, pou non Mwen kapab pwoklame toupatou nan lemonn.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Konsa, L ap fè mizerikòd a sila Li vle a, e l ap fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:21">Egz 4:21</ref></char></note>kè di a sila Li pito a.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Konsa nou va di m: “Poukisa Li toujou jwenn fot? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:6">II Kwo 20:6</ref></char></note>Kilès ki kab reziste a volonte Li.” <verse eid="ROM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Okontrè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:13">Job 33:13</ref></char></note>kilès ou ye, o lòm, k ap bay Bondye repons lan? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:16">És 29:16</ref></char></note>Bagay ki moulen avèk ajil la pa kapab di a moun ki fè l la: “Poukisa ou te fè m konsa?” Se pa sa? <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Èske mèt kanari a pa gen dwa sou ajil la, pou l sèvi menm sous ajil la pou fè yon kanari gwo valè e yon kanari komen? <verse eid="ROM 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Kisa, si Bondye, malgre volonte L pou montre lakòlè Li, ak fè moun wè pwisans Li, te andire avèk anpil pasyans ak veso lakòlè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 16:4">Pwov 16:4</ref></char></note>ki te prepare pou detwi yo. <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>Epi Li te fè sa pou Li ta kapab fè wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:4">Wo 2:4</ref></char></note>richès laglwa Li sou veso mizerikòd yo, ke li te prepare davans pou glwa Li, <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>menm nou menm ke Li te rele osi yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:29">Wo 3:29</ref></char></note>non sèlman pami Jwif yo, men anplis pami pèp etranje yo. <verse eid="ROM 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Jan Li di osi nan Osée a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 2:23">Os 2:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Mwen va rele sila ki pa te pèp mwen yo, ‘pèp mwen’,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">e sila ki pa t byeneme Mwen yo, ‘byeneme’”<verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>“Epi li va rive ke nan plas kote Li te di yo a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:10">Os 1:10</ref></char></note>‘Nou pa pèp mwen’,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">la menm, yo va rele yo fis a Bondye Vivan an.’”<verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Ésaïe te kriye fò pou Israël:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:22">És 10:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Malgre fis a Israël yo anpil tankou grenn sab lanmè, se yon ti retay ki va sove”.<verse eid="ROM 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:23">És 10:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Paske Bondye va egzekite pawòl Li sou latè avèk vitès, san manke anyen.<verse eid="ROM 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>Epi jan Ésaïe te prevwa a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:9">És 1:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Amwenske Senyè dèzame yo pa t kite yon posterite pou nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">nou ta devni tankou Sodome;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">nou ta sanble Gomorrhe.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Konsa, kisa nou kapab di? Ke pèp etranje yo, ki pa t chache ladwati Bondye a, te twouve ladwati, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:17">Wo 1:17</ref></char></note>ladwati menm ki pa lafwa a. <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Men Israël <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:1">És 51:1</ref></char></note>ki t ap chèche yon lwa ladwati, pa t rive nan lwa sa a. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Poukisa? Paske yo pa t chèche li pa lafwa, men konsi se te pa zèv. Yo te bite, sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14">És 8:14</ref></char></note>wòch bite a. <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>Jis jan sa ekri a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 28:16">És 28:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Gade, m ap mete yon wòch nan Sion k ap fè moun bite;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:14">És 8:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>yon wòch k ap yon ofans,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">e sila ki kwè nan Li Menm nan, p ap janm desi.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Frè m yo, dezi kè m ak lapriyè m a Bondye se pou tout Jwif yo kapab sove. <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Paske mwen temwaye de yo ke yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:20">Trav 21:20</ref></char></note>gen yon zèl pou Bondye, men pa selon bon konprann yo. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Paske san konesans de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:17">Wo 1:17</ref></char></note>ladwati Bondye a, yo te eseye etabli ladwati pa yo, e yo pa t soumèt yo menm a jistis Bondye a. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:1-4">Wo 7:1-4</ref></char></note>Kris fè lalwa a ranpli pou ladwati de tout sila ki kwè yo.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Moïse te ekri ke moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref></char></note>ki pratike ladwati ki baze sou Lalwa a ap viv pa jistis sila a. <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:30">Wo 9:30</ref></char></note>ladwati ki baze sou lafwa a, pale konsa: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:12">Det 30:12</ref></char></note>“Pa di nan kè ou ‘Kilès k ap monte nan syèl la?’ (Sa vle di pou fè Kris desann) <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>Oubyen: ‘Kilès k ap desann nan labim nan’ (sa vle di pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:20">Eb 13:20</ref></char></note>mennen Kris sòti nan lanmò).” <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Men kisa sa di? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:14">Det 30:14</ref></char></note>“Pawòl la toupre ou nan bouch ou, ak nan kè ou.” Sa vle di pawòl lafwa ke n ap preche a, <verse eid="ROM 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>ke si ou konfese avèk bouch ou Jésus kòm Senyè, e kwè nan kè ou ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:24">Trav 2:24</ref></char></note>Bondye te resisite L, soti nan lanmò, ou va sove. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Paske avèk kè yon moun kwè ki fè l rive nan ladwati a, e avèk bouch li konfese ki fè l va sove. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Paske Ekriti Sen an di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">És 28:16</ref></char></note>“Nenpòt moun ki kwè nan Li p ap desi.”<verse eid="ROM 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:22">Wo 3:22</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 3:29">29</ref></char></note>pa gen distenksyon antre Jwif ak Grèk; paske menm Senyè a se Senyè a tout moun, e Li plen richès pou tout sila ki rele Li yo. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:32">Jl 2:32</ref></char></note>“Nenpòt moun ki rele Non Senyè a ap sove.” <verse eid="ROM 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Konsa kòman yo va rele Li si yo pa janm kwè? Kòman yo va kwè nan Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:17">Ef 2:17</ref></char></note>si yo pa janm tande? Epi kòman yo va tande san <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:31">Trav 8:31</ref></char></note>yon predikatè? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Kòman yo va preche yo si yo pa voye ba yo? Jis jan sa ekri a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:15">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 52:7">És 52:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“A la bèl pye a sila ki pote bòn nouvèl</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:15">a bon bagay bèl yo!”<verse eid="ROM 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Sepandan, se pa tout moun ki te aksepte bòn nouvèl la; Ésaïe di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">És 53:1</ref></char></note>“Senyè, kilès ki kwè rapò nou an?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Konsa lafwa soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:2">Gal 3:2</ref>,<ref loc="GAL 3:5">5</ref></char></note>tande, e tande pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16">Kol 3:16</ref></char></note>pawòl a Kris la. <verse eid="ROM 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Men mwen di: “Byensi, yo pa janm tande; se pa sa?” Anfèt yo tande:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 19:4">Sòm 19:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Vwa pa yo ale sou tout latè e pawòl pa yo rive jis nan dènye pwent mond lan.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">Epi pawòl yo rive nan tout pwent latè a.<verse eid="ROM 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Men mwen di: “Byensi Israël pa t konnen; se pa sa?” Dabò, Moïse di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:21">Det 32:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“M ap fè nou jalou pou sa ki pa yon nasyon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">avèk yon nasyon san konprann, m ap fè nou fache.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Ésaïe, ak kouraj te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:1">És 65:1</ref></char></note>“Mwen te twouve pa sila ki pa t chache M yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">Mwen te vin parèt a sila ki pa t mande pou mwen yo.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>Men selon Israël Li di: “Mwen lonje men m tout lajounen bay yon pèp tèt di e dezobeyisan.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>Konsa, mwen mande: Èske Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 12:22">I Sam 12:22</ref></char></note>rejte pèp Li a? Pa janm panse sa! Paske mwen se yon Izrayelit tou, yon desandan Abraham, ki sòti nan tribi Benjamin an. <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 94:14">Sòm 94:14</ref></char></note>pa janm rejte pèp Li a ke Li te konnen oparavan an. Èske ou pa konnen sa Ekriti a di nan pasaj sou Élie, jan li te plede avèk Bondye kont Israël? <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>“Senyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">I Wa 19:10</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 19:14">14</ref></char></note>yo touye pwofèt ou yo; yo kraze lotèl ou yo. Se mwen sèl ki rete, e y ap chèche touye m tou.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Men ki repons ojis Bondye te bay li?: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">I Wa 19:18</ref></char></note>“Mwen kenbe pou Mwen menm sèt-mil òm ki pa t mete ajenou devan Baal.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Nou konprann menm jan ke nan tan prezan pa nou anplis, nou twouve yon retay nan pèp la pa gras ak chwa Bondye. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:4">Wo 4:4</ref></char></note>si se pa gras sa rive, li pa baze ankò sou zèv. Otreman li pa t ap gras ankò. Men si se pa zèv, li pa gras ankò. Otreman, zèv se pa zèv ankò.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Alò, Kisa? Sa ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:31">Wo 9:31</ref></char></note>Israël ap cheche a, sa a, li pa t twouve. Men sila yo ki te chwazi pa Bondye, te twouve l, e rès la te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:52">Mc 6:52</ref></char></note>di nan kè. <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>Jis jan sa te ekri a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:4">Det 29:4</ref></char></note>“Bondye te bay yo yon espri sòt, zye pou yo pa wè, ak zòrèy pou yo pa tande jiska menm jou sila a.”<verse eid="ROM 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Konsa, David di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:22">Sòm 69:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Kite tab yo devni yon pèlen ak yon pyèj;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">yon wòch bite ak yon chatiman pou yo.<verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:23">Sòm 69:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kite zye yo vin nwa pou yo pa wè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:10">ak do yo koube pou tout tan.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Konsa, mwen mande: “Yo pa t glise tonbe nèt”? Se pa sa! Sa p ap janm rive konsa! Men pa transgresyon pa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:28">Trav 28:28</ref></char></note>sali a gen tan rive a pèp etranje yo pou fè yo jalou. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Alò, si transgresyon pa yo se richès pou mond lan, e echèk pa yo se richès pou pèp etranje yo, konbyen anplis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:25">Wo 11:25</ref></char></note>pou lè yo menm reyisi?<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Paske m ap pale avèk nou menm ki se pèp etranje yo. Otan ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:15">Trav 9:15</ref></char></note>mwen menm se yon apòt a pèp etranje yo, mwen leve sèvis ministè pa m byen wo. <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>Men pou si l ta ka vin fèt (ke pa yon mwayen oswa yon lòt), si mwen ta kapab eksite pwòp pèp mwen an a jalouzi, pou m ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 1:21">I Kwo 1:21</ref></char></note>sove kèk, mwen ta fè l. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Paske si rejeksyon pa yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:11">Wo 5:11</ref></char></note>rekonsilyasyon pou tout mond lan, kisa l ap ye menm lè yo vin aksepte, sof ke lavi k ap sòti nan lanmò.<verse eid="ROM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Si <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:18">Nonb 15:18</ref></char></note>premye mòso ki sòti nan pat pen an sen, tout rès la ap sen tou, e si rasin lan sen, tout branch yo ap sen tou. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Men si kèk nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:2">Jn 15:2</ref></char></note>branch yo te kase retire, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:11">Ef 2:11</ref></char></note>ou menm, kòm yon oliv sovaj, te vin grefe pami yo, e te devni yon pati vivan avèk yo nan gwo rasin pye oliv la, <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>pa vin awogan anvè branch yo. Men si ou ta vin awogan, sonje ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:22">Jn 4:22</ref></char></note>se pa ou menm ki bay soutyen a rasin lan, men li menm ki bay ou soutyen. <verse eid="ROM 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:19">Wo 9:19</ref></char></note>Konsa ou va di: “Men branch yo te kase pou m te kab vin grefe ladan yo”. <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Se sa li ye; yo te kase akoz de enkwayans yo, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:2">Wo 5:2</ref></char></note>ou kanpe pa lafwa ou. Pa vin fè pretansye, men gen lakrent. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Paske si Bondye pa t konsève branch orijinal yo, Li p ap konsève ou menm nonplis. <verse eid="ROM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Konsa, byen gade bonte ak severite Bondye a. Anvè sila ki tonbe yo, severite, men pou ou menm, bonte Li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:2">I Kwo 15:2</ref></char></note>si ou kontinye nan bonte Li. Otreman, l ap retire ou tou. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Konsa, yo menm tou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 3:16">II Kwo 3:16</ref></char></note>si yo pa kontinye nan enkwayans yo, y ap grefe ladann ankò. Paske Bondye toujou kapab grefe yo ladann. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Paske si ou te koupe soti nan yon bwa ki pa nati li, te yon bwa oliv sovaj, e ou te vin grefe kont nati, nan yon bwa oliv ki kiltive, konbyen anplis tout branch sila yo ki se branch natirèl va grefe nan bwa oliv orijinal la.<verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Paske mwen pa vle nou, frè m yo, manke konprann mistè sila a<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:16">Wo 12:16</ref></char></note>pouke ou vin sipoze ou plen ak sajès. Yon tèt di nan yon pati gen tan pran Israël jiskaske tout pèp etranje yo fin antre. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Konsa, tout Israël va sove. Jis jan sa ekri a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:20">És 59:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Sila k ap delivre a va sòti de Sion.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">Li va retire enkwayans a Jacob.”<verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:21">És 59:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Sa se akò Mwen avèk yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:27">lè Mwen va retire peche pa yo.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Nan bi bòn nouvèl la, yo menm se lènmi pou benefis pa nou. Men selon bi chwa Bondye a, yo se byeneme pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:28">Wo 8:28</ref></char></note>benefis a zansèt yo. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Paske kado ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:28">Wo 8:28</ref></char></note>apèl Bondye pa revokab. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Menm jan ke yon fwa ou te nan dezobeyisans a Bondye, men koulye a Li bannou gras akoz dezobeyisans a Jwif yo, <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>konsa, yo menm tou dezobeyisan koulye a, men akoz mizerikòd Bondye gen tan bannou, yo kapab twouve gras tou. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:9">Wo 3:9</ref></char></note>Bondye gen tan fèmen nou tout nan dezobeyisans pou li kapab montre nou tout mizerikòd li.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>O, pwofondè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:4">Wo 2:4</ref></char></note>richès a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:3">Kol 2:3</ref></char></note>sajès ak konesans Bondye! A la ensondab Jijman Li ensondab! A la chemen Li yo depase konprann!<verse eid="ROM 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">És 40:13</ref></char></note>“Kilès ki konnen panse a Senyè a?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">Oubyen “Kilès ki kapab bay Li konsèy?”<verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>Oswa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 35:7">Job 35:7</ref></char></note>“Kilès ki konn bay Li yon bagay</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:35">pou Li kapab repeye li ankò?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 8:6">I Kwo 8:6</ref></char></note>soti nan Li, atravè Li, e akoz Li se tout bagay. A Li menm laglwa jis pou tout tan, Amen.<verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Konsa, frè m yo, mwen egzòte nou pa tout mizerikòd Bondye yo, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:13">Wo 6:13</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 6:19">19</ref></char></note>prezante kò nou kon yon sakrifis vivan e sen, ki se sèvis fidèl ke nou rann pou adore Bondye. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Pou sa a, pa konfòme nou a mond sa a, men transfòme nou pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:23">Ef 4:23</ref></char></note>renouvèlman lespri nou, pou nou kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:10">Ef 5:10</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 5:17">17</ref></char></note>pwouve sa ke volonte Bondye a ye; sa ki bon, akseptab e konplè san manke anyen.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Paske selon gras ke mwen resevwa a, mwen di a chak moun pami nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:20">Wo 11:20</ref></char></note>pou pa panse pi wo de tèt li pase sa li ta dwe panse a; men panse avèk yon jijman rezonab, konsi, Bondye te bay chak moun yon mezi lafwa. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 12:12-14">I Kwo 12:12-14</ref></char></note>menm jan ke kò nou gen anpil manm e tout manm sa yo pa gen menm fonksyon, <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>konsa nou menm tou ki anpil, nou fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 12:20">I Kwo 12:20</ref>,<ref loc="1CH 12:27">27</ref></char></note>yon sèl kò nan Kris la, e nou chak manm youn ak lòt. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Akoz nou gen don ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:3">Wo 12:3</ref></char></note>pa menm, selon gras ke nou resevwa a, annou chak sèvi yo konsa; si se pwofetize, sèvi l selon mezi lafwa ke Bondye bannou; <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>si se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:1">Trav 6:1</ref></char></note>fè sèvis, nan sèvi moun, si se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:1">Trav 13:1</ref></char></note>enstwi, nan enstwi, <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>si se egzòte moun, nan egzòtasyon; si se bay, bay avèk jenewozite; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:17">I Tim 5:17</ref></char></note>si se dirije, dirije avèk dilijans, si se bay mizerikòd, bay li avèk kè kontan.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Se pou nou renmen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:6">II Kwo 6:6</ref></char></note>san ipokrizi. Rayi sa ki mal e kenbe fèm a sa ki bon. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Jn 13:34</ref></char></note>Se pou nou angaje nou youn ak lòt nan lanmou fratènèl; bay preferans youn pou lòt avèk lonè. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Pa fè bak nan dilijans, rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:25">Trav 18:25</ref></char></note>zele nan lespri nou, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:19">Trav 20:19</ref></char></note>nan sèvis Senyè a, <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:2">Wo 5:2</ref></char></note>rejwi nou nan esperans, rete pasyan nan tribilasyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:14">Trav 5:14</ref></char></note>pèsevere nan lapriyè. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 9:1">II Kwo 9:1</ref></char></note>Kontribye pou bezwen a sen yo, e toujou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:35">Mat 25:35</ref></char></note>pratike ospitalite.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mat 5:44</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Beni sila ki pèsekite nou yo, bay benediksyon e pa bay madichon. <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 30:25">Job 30:25</ref></char></note>Rejwi avèk sila ki rejwi yo, e kriye avèk sila ki kriye yo. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Kenbe menm panse a youn anvè lòt. Pa kite ògèy antre nan lespri nou, men toujou asosye nou avèk sa ki enb yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:7">Pwov 3:7</ref></char></note>Pa konprann ke se nou menm ki saj. <verse eid="ROM 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 20:22">Pwov 20:22</ref></char></note>Pa janm remèt mal pou mal a pèsòn. Respekte sa ki bon nan zye a tout moun. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Si se posib, otan ke li depann de nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mc 9:50</ref></char></note>rete anpè avèk tout moun. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Pa janm pran pwòp vanjans nou, byeneme mwen yo, men kite plas pou kòlè Bondye a. Paske sa ekri: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Det 32:35</ref></char></note>“Vanjans se pou Mwen; Mwen menm va bay rekonpans”, di Senyè a.<verse eid="ROM 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 6:22">II Wa 6:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Konsa, si lènmi nou grangou, bay li manje;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">e si li swaf, bay li bwè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">Paske lè nou fè l konsa, nou sanble moso chabon cho sou tèt li.”<verse eid="ROM 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Pa kite nou venk pa le mal, men venk mal la avèk sa ki bon.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Chak moun dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 3:1">Tit 3:1</ref></char></note>obeyisan ak otorite gouvènman yo. Paske pa gen otorite sof ke li sòti nan Bondye, e sila ki egziste yo etabli pa Bondye. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Konsa, nenpòt moun ki reziste a otorite, opoze a òdonans Bondye a. E sila ki opoze yo va resevwa kondanasyon sou pwòp tèt yo. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:14">I Pi 2:14</ref></char></note>sila yo ki nan otorite p ap koz laperèz pou sila ki gen bon kondwit yo, men pou sila ki fè mal yo. Èske nou vle pa gen laperèz pou otorite? Fè sa ki bon e yo va bannou lwanj. <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>Paske li menm se sèvitè Bondye anvè nou menm pou sa ki bon. Men si nou fè sa ki mal, fòk nou pè; paske li pa pote nepe pou granmesi. Paske li se yon sèvitè Bondye, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:6">I Tes 4:6</ref></char></note>vanjè k ap pote kòlè sou sila ki pratike mechanste yo. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Konsa, li nesesè pou nou soumèt nou. Sa pa fèt sèlman akoz krent lakòlè a, men osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 8">Ekl 8</ref></char></note>akoz bon konsyans pa nou. <verse eid="ROM 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Se pou sa tou ke nou toujou peye taks leta a; paske sila k ap gouvène yo se sèvitè Bondye ki te plase espre pou sèvis sa a. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:21">Mat 22:21</ref></char></note>Bay yo tout sa ke nou dwe yo; taks a sila nou dwe taks yo, enpo a sila nou dwe enpo yo, lakrent a sila ke nou dwe krent yo, onè a sila ke nou dwe onè yo.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Pa dwe anyen a pèsòn, eksepte renmen youn lòt; paske sila ki renmen vwazen li, akonpli lalwa a. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Egz 20:13</ref></char></note>“Pa fè adiltè, Pa touye moun, Pa vòlè, pa gen lanvi pou sa ki nan lòt”, epi si gen lòt kòmandman, li ranpli nan pawòl sa a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char></note>“Ou va renmen vwazen ou tankou tèt ou.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Lanmou pa janm fè mal a yon vwazen, konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mat 7:12</ref></char></note>lanmou toujou akonpli lalwa a.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Fè sa, paske nou konnen lè a. Lè a rive pou nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:37">Mc 13:37</ref></char></note>leve nan dòmi, paske delivrans nou pi prè pase lè nou te kwè a. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Nwit lan prèske fini; jounen an prè. Konsa, annou mete sou kote tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:11">Ef 5:11</ref></char></note>zèv tenèb yo, e abiye nou ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:11">Ef 6:11</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:13">13</ref></char></note>pwotèj limyè a. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Annou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:12">I Tes 4:12</ref></char></note>gen bon kondwit tankou nan lajounen. Pa antre nan banbòch ak eksè bwè, ni nan tout zak imoral, sansyèl, goumen, ak jalouzi. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 29:14">Job 29:14</ref></char></note>abiye nou ak Senyè Jésus Kri a e pa fè pwovizyon pou lachè ak tout dezi li yo.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:2">Trav 28:2</ref></char></note>aksepte sila ki fèb nan lafwa a, men pa pou diskisyon sou tout opinyon yo. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Yon moun gen lafwa pou li kab manje tout bagay, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:1">Wo 14:1</ref></char></note>sila ki fèb la manje sèlman legim. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Sila ki manje a pa dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:9">Luc 18:9</ref></char></note>meprize sila ki pa manje a, e sila ki pa manje a pa dwe jije sila ki manje a, paske Bondye aksepte li. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:20">Wo 9:20</ref></char></note>Ki moun nou ye pou jije sèvitè a yon lòt? Devan pwòp mèt pa li l ap kanpe oubyen l ap tonbe. E l ap kanpe menm, paske Bondye kapab fè l kanpe.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 4:10">Gal 4:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yon moun gade yon jou kòm pi enpòtan ke yon lòt, yon lòt menm gade ke tout jou yo menm. Kite chak moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:21">Wo 4:21</ref></char></note>vin byen konvenk nan konsyans pa li. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Sila ki kenbe enpòtans a yon jou, li fè l pou Senyè a, e sila ki pa kenbe l, se a Senyè a li pa fè l. Epi sila ki manje, se pou Senyè a ke li manje, paske li bay remèsiman a Bondye. Epi li ki pa manje, pa manje a Senyè a, paske li bay Bondye remèsiman. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Paske pa gen youn nan nou ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:38">Wo 8:38</ref></char></note>viv pou tèt li, ni pa gen youn ki mouri pou tèt li. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Si nou viv, nou viv pou Senyè a, oubyen si nou mouri, nou mouri pou Senyè a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 20:38">Luc 20:38</ref></char></note>Donk kit nou viv, oswa kit nou mouri, se a Senyè a. <verse eid="ROM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Pou rezon sa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:18">Rev 1:18</ref></char></note>Kris te mouri , Li te resisite, e Li te viv ankò, pou Li te kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:11">Fil 2:11</ref></char></note>Senyè pou ni sa ki mouri ak sa ki vivan.<verse eid="ROM 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Men nou menm, poukisa nou jije frè nou an? Oswa, nou menm ankò, poukisa nou meprize frè nou an? Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:16">Wo 2:16</ref></char></note>nou tout va kanpe devan chèz jijman Bondye a. <verse eid="ROM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>Paske sa ekri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:23">És 45:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Jan Mwen vivan an, di Senyè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">tout jenou ap bese devan Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">e tout lang ap bay lwanj a Bondye”.<verse eid="ROM 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:36">Mat 12:36</ref></char></note>nou chak ap rann kont de tèt li, bay Bondye.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Konsa, annou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:1">Mat 7:1</ref></char></note>pa jije youn lòt ankò. Men olye de sa, annou detèmine pou nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 8:13">I Kwo 8:13</ref></char></note>pa mete okenn obstak oubyen wòch k ap fè moun bite sou wout a yon frè. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Mwen konnen e mwen byen konvenk nan Senyè a Jésus ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:15">Trav 10:15</ref></char></note>pa gen anyen ki pa pwòp nan li menm; men pou sila a ki panse ke yon bagay pa pwòp, pou li menm li pa pwòp la. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Paske si se pou afè manje nou ke frè nou an vin blese a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:2">Ef 5:2</ref></char></note>nou p ap mache nan lanmou ankò. Pa detwi pou afè manje nou an, sila pou kilès Kris te mouri an. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Konsa pa kite sa ki bon bagay pou ou a, vin pale pa lòt yo kòm yon mal. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Paske wayòm Bondye a se pa manje ak bwè, men se ladwati <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:13">Wo 15:13</ref></char></note>lapè, ak lajwa nan Lespri Sen an. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Sila ki sèvi Kris konsa a akseptab a Bondye, e apwouve pa lèzòm. <verse eid="ROM 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Donk konsa, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:14">Sòm 34:14</ref></char></note>pouswiv bagay k ap fè nou gen lapè yo, e k ap soutni nou youn lòt. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Pa dechire travay Bondye a pou afè manje. Anfèt tout bagay pwòp, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 8:9-12">I Kwo 8:9-12</ref></char></note>yo mal pou moun ki manje e ki ofanse lòt moun. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 8:13">I Kwo 8:13</ref></char></note>Se bon pou pa manje vyann ni bwè diven oubyen fè nenpòt bagay k ap fè frè ou a chite. <verse eid="ROM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Lafwa ke ou genyen an, genyen li kòm pwòp konviksyon pa w devan Bondye. Beni se sila a ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:21">I Jn 3:21</ref></char></note>pa kondane pwòp tèt li nan sa ke li apwouve. <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:5">Wo 14:5</ref></char></note>sila ki doute a gen tan fin kondane si li manje, paske manje li a pa fèt ak lafwa; e nenpòt bagay ki pa fèt ak lafwa, se peche.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Alò nou menm ki fò, nou dwe sipòte feblès <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:1">Wo 14:1</ref></char></note>sila ki san fòs yo, e se pa sèlman fè pwòp tèt nou plezi. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Ke chak en de nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:22">I Kwo 9:22</ref></char></note>fè kè vwazen nou alèz pou l ka jwenn tout sa ki bon, k ap fè l plen konfyans. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 8:9">II Kwo 8:9</ref></char></note>menm Kris pa t fè tèt li plezi, menm jan sa ekri a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Sòm 69:9</ref></char></note>“Repwòch de sila ki te repwoche ou yo te tonbe sou Mwen.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:23">Wo 4:23</ref></char></note>tout bagay ki te ekri nan tan pase yo te ekri pou enstwi nou menm; pouke selon pèseverans ak ankourajman Ekriti yo, nou ta kapab vin genyen lespwa. <verse eid="ROM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Koulye a mwen priye, pou menm Bondye ki bay pèseverans ak ankourajman an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:16">Wo 12:16</ref></char></note>kapab fè nou gen menm panse, youn avèk lòt atravè Jésus Kris: <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>Pouke nan tout akò pou nou kapab avèk yon sèl vwa bay glwa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:6">Rev 1:6</ref></char></note>Bondye, Papa a Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:1">Wo 14:1</ref></char></note>aksepte youn lòt, menm jan ke Kris osi te aksepte nou pou laglwa Bondye a. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Paske mwen di ke Kris gen tan vin yon sèvitè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:24">Mat 15:24</ref></char></note>sila ki sikonsi yo, anfavè verite a Bondye a pou konfime pwomès ki te fèt a zansèt yo; <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>epi pou pèp etranje yo ta ka bay Bondye glwa pou mizerikòd Li, jan sa ekri a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 22:50">II Sam 22:50</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Konsa, Mwen va bay Ou lwanj pami pèp etranje yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">e mwen va chante Non Ou.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Li di ankò:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:43">Det 32:43</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Rejwi, O pèp etranje yo avèk pèp Li a.”<verse eid="ROM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>Epi ankò:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 117:1">Sòm 117:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Bay lwanj a Senyè a, nou tout pèp etranje yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">Kite tout pèp yo ba Li lwanj.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Esaïe di ankò:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:10">És 11:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Li va gen rasin Jessé a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">Sila ki leve pou renye sou pèp etranje yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">Nan Li menm, pèp etranje yo va mete espwa yo.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Koulye a, ke Bondye esperans lan kapab ranpli nou avèk lajwa ak lapè nan lafwa pouke nou kapab plen avèk esperans pa pwisans a Lespri Sen an.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Epi konsènan nou menm, frè mwen yo, mwen gen konviksyon ke nou menm, nou plen ak bonte, byen ranpli avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 1:5">I Kwo 1:5</ref></char></note>tout konesans, e kapab osi egzòte youn lòt. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Men mwen ekri nou avèk kouraj sou kèk pwen pou fè nou sonje ankò, akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:3">Wo 12:3</ref></char></note>gras Bondye ke mwen resevwa a, <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>pou m kapab yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:15">Trav 9:15</ref></char></note>sèvitè Jésus Kris pou pèp etranje yo, pou m fè sèvis kòm yon prèt pou levanjil Bondye a, jis pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:1">Wo 12:1</ref></char></note>ofrann mwen bay pèp etranje yo kapab vin akseptab, e byen sanktifye pa Lespri Sen an. <verse eid="ROM 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Konsa, nan Jésus Kri mwen gen tan twouve rezon pou vante tèt mwen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:17">Eb 2:17</ref></char></note>bagay ki apatyen a Bondye. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Mwen p ap pèmèt mwen pale de okenn bagay sof de sa ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:12">Trav 15:12</ref></char></note>Kris gen tan akonpli atravè mwen an, kon rezilta a, obeyisans pèp etranje yo pa pawòl ak aksyon, <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>nan pouvwa sign ak mirak yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:13">Wo 15:13</ref></char></note>nan pouvwa Lespri a, pouke soti Jérusalem jis rive nan Illyrie ak anviwon peyi a, mwen fin preche tout levanjil a Kris la. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Se konsa mwen vle preche levanjil la; pa kote ke Kris te deja konnen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 3:10">I Kwo 3:10</ref></char></note>pou m pa bati sou fondasyon a yon lòt moun, <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>Men jan sa ekri a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 52:15">És 52:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Sila ki pa gen nouvèl Li yo va wè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">e sila ki pa tande yo va konprann”.<verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Pou rezon sa a byen souvan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:13">Wo 1:13</ref></char></note>mwen anpeche vin kote nou. <verse eid="ROM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Men koulye a, akoz pa gen lòt andwa pou mwen nan rejyon sa yo, e depi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Trav 19:21</ref></char></note>anpil ane mwen anvi vin wè nou, <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>nenpòt lè mwen ale Espagne, mwen espere wè nou pandan m ap pase. Konsa nou kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:3">Trav 15:3</ref></char></note>ede m fin rive la apre mwen fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:12">Wo 1:12</ref></char></note>rejwi de prezans nou pandan kèk tan. <verse eid="ROM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Men koulye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Trav 19:21</ref></char></note>mwen prale Jérusalem pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:17">Trav 24:17</ref></char></note>sèvi fidèl yo. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Paske legliz yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:9">Trav 16:9</ref></char></note>Macédoine ak Achaïe te kontan fè yon don pou malere yo pami fidèl Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Wi, yo te kontan fè sa, e yo dwe yo. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:11">I Kwo 9:11</ref></char></note>si pèp etranje yo gen tan pataje bagay ki soti nan Lespri Bondye a, yo dwe remèt sèvis a yo tou ak bagay materyèl. <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Konsa, lè m fin fè sa, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:33">Jn 3:33</ref></char></note>mete so mwen sou fwi sa ki sòti nan yo menm nan, m ap pase bò kote nou nan wout pou m ale Espagne la. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Mwen konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Trav 19:21</ref></char></note>lè m vin kote nou, m ap vini byen ranpli avèk benediksyon a Kris la.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Koulye a mwen ankouraje nou, frè m yo, pa Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri e pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:8">Kol 1:8</ref></char></note>lanmou Lespri a, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 1:11">I Kwo 1:11</ref></char></note>fè tout efò ansanm avèk mwen nan lapriyè a Bondye pou mwen menm <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>pou mwen kapab delivre anba sila yo nan Juda ki dezobeyisan, e pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:25">Wo 15:25</ref></char></note>sèvis mwen pou Jérusalem kapab akseptab devan fidèl yo, <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>pou mwen kapab vini a nou menm nan lajwa pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:21">Trav 18:21</ref></char></note>volonte Bondye e pou m twouve yon repo rafrechisan an konpayi de nou menm. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Pou koulye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:20">Wo 16:20</ref></char></note>ke Bondye lapè a kapab avèk nou tout. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 3:1">II Kwo 3:1</ref></char></note>rekòmande a nou sè nou Phoebé, yon sèvant legliz ki nan Cenchrée a. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Pou nou resevwa li nan non Senyè a nan yon jan ke fidèl yo ta dwe fè, e pou nou ede li nan nenpòt bezwen ke li kapab genyen. Paske li menm<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:29">Fil 2:29</ref></char></note> se yon èd pou anpil lòt moun, ak pou mwen menm tou.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>Salye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Trav 18:2</ref></char></note>Prisca ak Aquilas, ouvriyè yo nan travay mwen nan Jésus Kris, <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>moun ki te riske pwòp tèt yo pou lavi m. Se pa sèlman a yo menm ke m di mèsi, men a tout legliz pèp etranje yo. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Salye osi tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:19">I Kwo 16:19</ref></char></note>legliz la ki reyini lakay yo a. Salye Épaïnète, zanmi byeneme m, ki te premye konvèti an Asie a. <verse eid="ROM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Salye Marie ki travay di pou nou. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Salye Andronicus ak Junias, paran mwen yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref></char></note>prizonye parèy mwen yo, ki byen remakab pami apot yo, e ki te nan Kris la avan m. <verse eid="ROM 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Salye Amplias, zanmi byeneme m nan Senyè a. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Salye Urbain, ouvriye parèy a nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:11">Wo 8:11</ref></char></note>nan Kris la ak Stachys, zanmi byeneme m nan. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Salye Apellès, ki apwouve <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:11">Wo 8:11</ref></char></note>nan Kris la; salye sila ki lakay Aristobule yo. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Salye Hérodion <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:3">Wo 9:3</ref></char></note>fanmi mwen. Salye sila ki lakay Narcisse yo, ki nan Senyè a. <verse eid="ROM 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Salye Tryphène ak Tryphose, ouvriye nan Senyè a. Salye Perside, byeneme a, ki travay di nan Senyè a. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Salye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:21">Mc 15:21</ref></char></note>Rufus, yon nonm chwazi nan Senyè a, manman li osi e ki tankou manman pa m tou. <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Salye Asyncrite, Phlégon, Hermès, Patrobas, Hermas, ak tout frè ki avèk yo. <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Salye Philologue ak Julie, Nérée ak sè li, e Olympe, e tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:2">Wo 16:2</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 16:14">14</ref></char></note>fidèl ki avèk yo. <verse eid="ROM 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:20">I Kwo 16:20</ref></char></note>Salye youn lòt avèk yon bo ki sen. Tout legliz Kris la salye nou.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Koulye a, frè mwen yo, mwen ankouraje nou pou toujou veye sou sila k ap koze e fè blokis ki kontrè a enstriksyon nou te resevwa a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:18">Mat 7:18</ref></char></note>Vire do nou ba yo menm. <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Paske moun konsa se esklav yo ye, pa a Senyè nou an, Kris la, men a pwòp apeti pa yo. Ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:4">Kol 2:4</ref></char></note>pawòl ki dous e flatè, yo desi kè a inosan yo. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Paske rapò obeyisans nou an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:8">Wo 1:8</ref></char></note>gen tan rive toupatou. Konsa mwen rejwi de nou, men mwen vle nou saj nan sa ki bon e inosan nan sa ki mal. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:33">Wo 15:33</ref></char></note>Bondye lapè a va kraze Satan anba pye nou toutalè.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Ke lagras Senyè nou an Jésus kapab avèk nou.<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Trav 16:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Timothée, kanmarad travay mwen, salye nou, e osi Lucius ak Jason ak Sosipater ki se fanmi mwen. <verse eid="ROM 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Mwen menm, Tertius <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:21">I Kwo 16:21</ref></char></note>k ap ekri lèt sa a, salye nou nan Senyè a. <verse eid="ROM 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Trav 19:29</ref></char></note>Gaïus ki te ban m kote pou m rete ak tout legliz la, salye nou. Éraste, trezorye vil la salye nou ak Quartus osi, frè a. <verse eid="ROM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>Ke lagras Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri, rete avèk nou tout. Amen. <verse eid="ROM 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Koulye a, a Sila ki kapab etabli nou selon bòn nouvèl mwen an ak predikasyon a Jésus Kri a, atravè revelasyon a mistè a ke li te kenbe an sekrè pandan tout tan pase yo, <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>men koulye a ki vin manifeste, selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:2">Wo 1:2</ref></char></note>Ekriti Sen a pwofèt yo, ak kòmandman a Bondye etènèl la, ki vin konnen pa tout nasyon yo, ki mennen rive a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:5">Wo 1:5</ref></char></note>obeyisans lafwa a. <verse eid="ROM 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>A Bondye sèl ki saj la, atravè Jésus Kris <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:36">Wo 11:36</ref></char></note>ki se laglwa pou tout tan an. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
